      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Abt">Abt</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif cyning his leode to him gehateþ ⁊ heom mon þær yfel gedo, II bóte, ⁊ cyninge L scillinga.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If the king summons his people to him and a person does any harm to them there, 2[-fold] restitution and 50 shillings to the king.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif cyning his leode to him gehateþ, ⁊ heom mon þær yfel gedo, IIbóte ⁊ cyninge L scillinga.</ab>
